    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "clone flags say which resources are shared.",
      "narration": "For clone, inspect the flags instead of calling every child a thread. Sharing memory, descriptor tables, and thread group membership are distinct choices with constraints.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Read the flags",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
